                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>In addition to being driven normally, the pilot can enter their destination into a somnambupod's onboard AI by attempting a @Check[computers|dc:12] check.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The somnambupod arrives at its destination faster than expected. It gains a +15-foot status bonus to its Speed until it arrives.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The somnambupod arrives at its destination.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The somnambupod doesn't move an inch.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The somnambupod moves toward a point 10 kilometers in the opposite direction from its destination.</p>"
